  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Shashe Fruits and Horticulture Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to strengthen Shashe&apos;s competitiveness in the orange growth sector by reducing energy costs, increasing water access and providing better training to its membership. Shashe will establish policies and procedures to their strengthen management capacity and internal controls and will develop a business plan.</narrative>
